From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:26:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Aperture: add a high resolution photo toggle that locks zoom
 to 1x

tetra sensors only expose their full resolution size as a high
resolution size, which aperture never picks. add a top bar toggle that
switches to the high resolution jpeg size, forces 4:3 and jpeg only
since the hal skips remosaic with raw in the request, and locks zoom
to 1x since the hal can't crop remosaiced captures.

Change-Id: If20d1e635a68014f3b3023f0a439b5f2127cc615
---
